    "notes": [
      "Implements the first bounded Category Intelligence Foundation slice: URL-first public Business discovery and owner confirmation.",
      "Ordinary HTTPS public business websites, Wolt and Bolt Food are supported through a provider-neutral Public Business Snapshot; private connectors remain excluded.",
      "Generic public URL fetching is an SSRF boundary and must reject local/private/reserved targets and redirects.",
      "Public observations remain non-authoritative until owner confirmation; no fabricated business facts are permitted.",
      "The existing BrandMark boundary, manual Business creation path, authentication, Business isolation and modular-monolith architecture are preserved.",
      "No release, deployment or production enablement is authorized."
    ]
  },
